OL,3,GNEWSAFrom kitchen cleaner to restaurant
OL,4,Aboss employing 1,500
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhen Acky Khan was studying for his
OL,7,FO-Level exams, he took a job cleaning
OL,8,Fkitchens at a KFC restaurant in east
OL,9,FLondon.
OL,11,F"It was hard work. It's not the easiest
OL,12,Fof jobs, but once you get the hang of
OL,13,Fit, it was a really enjoyable
OL,14,Fexperience," he said.
OL,16,FMore than 40 years later, Khan employs
OL,17,Fabout 1,500 people across 50 KFC
OL,18,Frestaurants and 30 Starbucks coffee
OL,19,Fshops, including a newly opened
OL,20,Frestaurant at Meole Brace retail park
OL,21,Fin Shrewsbury.
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
